2026-09-05T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2229) '**RFD66606-2188 named &{repo("ggml")} as the single ggml source workspace-wide.** The manifest still ships three checkouts. Two of them (`trellis2cpp/ggml`, `ggml-seethrough`) are consumers still pinned to their own ggml revisions rather than reading through the shared source.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2229  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-05T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2229) '**Verification needed before trimming.** Whether each consumer has actually migrated to &{repo("ggml")}'s API, or whether the pinned revision holds something the consolidated source doesn't yet cover. A CI green on `trellis2-ex` and `seethrough` against &{repo("ggml")} is the measurement.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2229  1 LINE
 Text:Written

