2026-09-05T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2229) 'Three ggml-graph-in-C++ shapes with three separate build systems. All target the same interface: a C API that Godot's `modules/motionbricks/` (RFD66606-2212) wraps for scene-graph access. Consolidation candidate: one `ggml-godot-module-kit` that all three link, replacing three per-project CMake `if(NATIVE_WEBGPU)` branches with one shared fragment.
 # tags: rfd:details
