2026-09-05T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2229) 'Not urgent; the three projects are early enough that their build systems haven't diverged much. RFD66606-2188 shared source + a small build-fragment consolidation covers most of it. Concrete work is a follow-up L2 once RFD66606-2212's `modules/motionbricks` lands.
