2026-09-05T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2229) '**Not a candidate.** `weftspun-keypoint` is the single live goal manifest per CLAUDE.md's "Sides" rule; the archived `weftspun-mesh-latents` is placement history, not a parallel manifest.
 # tags: rfd:details
